  "worked_solution": "The solid is a **right cone**. \n\nNotice the following:\n\n- The solid has one circular base and one vertex. So, it's a cone.\n\n- The axis that passes through the center of the circle and the vertex is perpendicular to the base. So, it's right.",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"questionExplanation-107276\" class=\"questionExplanation\" style=\"display: block;\"><p>The solid is a <strong>right cone</strong>. </p>\n<p>Notice the following:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><p>The solid has one circular base and one vertex. So, it's a cone. </p>\n</li>\n<li><p>The axis that passes through the center of the circle and the vertex is perpendicular to the base. So, it's right.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"studentAnswerHeader\">Your Answer:</div><div class=\"studentAnswer\">Oblique Cylinder</div></div>",
